# Wild Roads: "This land enters tapped unless you control a Mount or Vehicle" (CR 614.1d), and "{1}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice this land:
# Create a 1/1 colorless Pilot creature token ... Activate only as a sorcery" (CR 602.5d, 111.1). Bot1 pays {2} for a
# Smuggler's Copter, a Vehicle (CR 301.7), with Mox Emerald and Mox Sapphire, so the land enters untapped. With {W}{R} from
# Mox Pearl and Mox Ruby, two mana but no green, the sacrifice is refused for its cost. On turn 3 it is refused in the
# upkeep, though the Moxen could pay, and made in the main phase with {G}{W}, all of which it spends: the land goes to the
# graveyard and a Pilot token arrives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Smuggler's Copter
Wild Roads
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

